# pseudopotential datasets are fetched, never committed (see README)
pseudos/
# ...except the four small CC BY 4.0 fixtures the test suite needs. Without this the rule
# above also swallows tests/data/pseudos/, and a clean clone cannot run its own tests --
# which is exactly how it was found, by the first CI run on a fresh checkout.
!tests/data/pseudos/

